      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW ESTRELLA (6) is racing well without winning, recording four minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when third (21.93) over 390m at Warrnambool. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Leading chance again. ANGRY ELLIE (8) should get a clear run from the wide draw. Safely held last start when a 4.5 lengths 7th at Sale (24.97). Goes very well at course and distance boasting eight wins. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Expected to give a good account. HARD TO ROCK (1) has a strong record this trip with six wins and eight placings from 17 starts. Below best last time at this track (23.23) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 8 length seventh. Looks a key chance on best figures. MASTER WOODS (2) recorded a 0.8 lengths win (22.01) in a Grade 4/5 last time at Shepparton. Has already won out of this draw.",
